  <History Date="16-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="19-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Varilite VLZ Spot (no frame location information - attribute editor representation might not be true to real life)" />
  <History Date="20-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Swapped Frame 2A/2B attribute ID's with 3A/3B in response to customer bug report." />
  <History Date="21-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID to 16-Bit mode." />
  <History Date="21-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised gobo 1 and fixed colour and added reset int control function and macro  in line with latest charts (supplied by Capture following manuf query)" />
  <History Date="20-11-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names.  Added colour index functions." />
  <History Date="20-11-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour scroll functions in response to manufacturer feedback via Atlabase (charts are wrong)" />
  <History Date="20-11-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches" />
